{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
{# The jarl's hold tax: "you" in the jarl's own speaker modes, third person in the drill-down and as a listener. Each
   action pointer renders only where the jarl can choose the action (NPC dialogue and the drill-down). #}
{% set _actionsOffered = render_mode == "action" or (render_mode == "full" and default(responseTarget.type, "none") != "none") %}
{% if isValidActor(actorUUID) %}
{% set tax_ctx = hold_tax_rate(actorUUID) %}
{% if tax_ctx != "" %}
## Hold Taxes
{{ tax_ctx }}
{% if render_mode == "dialogue_target" or render_mode == "action" %}
- As Jarl, {{ decnpc(actorUUID).name }} sets this tax and may ease or raise it.
{% if render_mode == "action" %}
- When {{ decnpc(actorUUID).name }} decides in this exchange to ease or raise it, select the **Taxes** action category, then **GrantTaxRelief** to ease it or **RaiseHoldTaxes** to raise it.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
- As Jarl, you set this tax on {{ player.name }}'s enterprises. A respectful, well-argued petition or real service to the hold may move you to ease it; insults, threats or brazen behavior may move you to raise it. Whether to budge, and which way, is your own judgment.
{% if _actionsOffered %}
- When you decide in this exchange, select the **Taxes** action category, then **GrantTaxRelief** or **RaiseHoldTaxes**.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
